<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups linked to ISIS are advancing in Cabo Delgado, directly threatening the region's gas project. An Irish survivor of a recent massacre gave testimony at an inquest, describing attacks on civilians. Médecins Sans Frontières reported an attack on a medical centre and called for protection of health facilities. The insurgency’s lethality remains evident, with 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Jagran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQYzhQZTZMQVdTWkNuQXNUR3R2dkljcC11bjBpSWlLYnVnM3RQaWlvTU50TG1pUk1QTWl0UEZ5VTNPcHFtTTdBMmxINkFrNVJMdFpySENZYWJFdDNZNWJKclpyXzFRRkdXUU0yaW03NHV1ZFUtMXc2cWxPR2tpdTkzc2xYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Beirut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOUkI5STkza05JYlBoOXItTHFjVk8wX3FmOG1QYkU1VWdYV1JoaEtiYm9vTDU4YVRQNWVEdEdoUlBEcmw1SFVJcHg2WXZsMy1wR2d1OXhXcnVaempNZkdnVmZPbTdmMDhGalFENi1hVW5FRVgzWG1nR1VGQWJpTHNHZ0FNTTJzcXZHNzhrSjU4cDJ0ejhtVFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;CLUB OF MOZAMBIQUE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPSGdzQWNCVEpGM1V6TWRqV2NBNkpLb2prc1BJa18wWVg3NlRvMlhaZ01vRHJLZHJuTDczOHNXdjBJUUNqVzJ4RDR3QUxBX21RNHU4RlM5bHktcFM5MGRMM3NOeWhqX0dnOU5KMjZtQXFhV3RtNVVabFFRTVhuOU1vbDJTMUkxN0JWaG5NcHhMN2M0VHcwNmwwUHVRTmVUcDFlTndHNmdrRFI4UHQxUEthcXk2cUpaOVVkcHVfb0pWOU5BRkxaU2M3Rlk0WlpIZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.standardmedia.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;СПЖ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Irish Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1KV2ROOWZDY3JMYWxvbS16c1Rva3FjT2FJcG5MT1NleXVYMzgwbVY4MzVJTDhCSUx1TnNuXzhfYnRQdGhhcHBvajRUdnpjdGM4NWYtYXYzTi1PS1kwNTJUM2ZLcVRNaWVJRkJHeFdTU1llM3BDRi1Z